      <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="color:#000000;font-family:'Calibri',sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Viking Gas Transmission has 100% of its inventory on a current basis. The fixed asset method is used for the valuation change for linepack.</span>
