    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-16" id="fn-16" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <table style="border-collapse:collapse;display:inline-table;margin-bottom:5pt;vertical-align:text-bottom;width:83.184%">
          <tr>
            <td style="width:1.0%"/>
            <td style="width:35.393%"/>
            <td style="width:0.1%"/>
            <td style="width:1.0%"/>
            <td style="width:35.393%"/>
            <td style="width:0.1%"/>
            <td style="width:1.0%"/>
            <td style="width:18.577%"/>
            <td style="width:0.1%"/>
            <td style="width:1.0%"/>
            <td style="width:6.237%"/>
            <td style="width:0.1%"/>
          </tr>
          <tr style="height:15pt">
            <td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/>
            <td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/>
            <td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/>
            <td colspan="3" style="padding:0 1pt"/>
          </tr>
          <tr style="height:74pt">
            <td colspan="12" rowspan="2" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">
              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">On December 22, 2017, the Tax Cuts and Jobs Act was signed into law. The Tax Cuts and Jobs Act made extensive changes to the U.S. tax laws and includes provisions that, beginning in 2018, reduced the U.S. Corporate tax rate from 35 percent to 21 percent. We administratively recorded regulatory liabilities associated with the revaluation of our deferred taxes due to the reduction in the corporate tax rate. In July 2020, the FERC approved our Stipulation and Offer of Settlement (the Settlement) on our rate proceeding under Section 4 of the Natural Gas Act of 1938. As part of the Settlement, reversal of the revaluation of excess tax reserve, through a normalization method of accounting over a period of 23 years, began in January 2020.</span>
            </td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td colspan="12" style="display:none"/>
          </tr>
        </table>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-17" id="fn-17" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Park and Loan is a balancing service; therefore, quantities are excluded as associated Dths used for balancing do not represent gas delivered.</span>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="fn-18" id="fn-18" xml:lang="en" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
