          </tr>
          <tr style="height:15pt">
            <td colspan="12" rowspan="2" style="padding:1.5pt 1pt;text-align:left;vertical-align:top">
              <span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">Gas is valued at a monthly average price of the higher of the weekly Emerson, Viking GL or ANR, ML7 points as published in the Platts Gas Daily publication.</span>
            </td>
